sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Given two circles about the same center, to inscribe in the greater circle an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the lesser circle.
----
proof:

Let {ABCD|circABCD} and {EFGH|circEFGH} be the two given circles about the same center {K}.

It is required to inscribe in the greater circle {ABCD|circABCD} an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the circle {EFGH|circEFGH}.

