              highlighted: ["LD","DN","circEFGH"] },
            { text: "If, then, we fit into the circle {ABCD|circABCD} straight lines equal to the straight line {LD} and placed repeatedly,",
              visible: REST,
              highlighted: ["circABCD","LD","DN"] },
            { text: "then there is inscribed in the circle {ABCD|circABCD} an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides",
